{"id": "80635733-bce5-4361-ab25-eac216327e6a", "sessionId": "79e665ab-643a-c54b-82c8-84d5e12732a2", "turnId": "74e9c883-8159-4ecd-b33b-409895237189", "createdAt": 1789591189386, "updatedAt": 1789591189943, "generationStatus": "completed", "relatedEntryId": null, "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The maximum retention period for a SCIM sync run's result is **30 days** [SCIM sync run results retention](https://docs.mistral.ai/platform/enterprise/scim#scim-sync-run-results-retention).\n\nCompleted runs **cannot** be purged early via the API; the documentation does not expose an endpoint for early deletion [SCIM API reference](https://docs.mistral.ai/platform/enterprise/scim#scim-api-reference)."}], "source": null, "userDisplayContent": null}
